{"id":"000VTL","title":"NATMOS 6: The rest is silence","author":"Neokart","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":5,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-01T06:18:27+00:00","posted":"Heute, 04:33 Uhr","rules":"Hi everyone. This is the 6th and final part of the series inspired by The Caretakers' album \"Nowhere at the Millennium of Space\".\n\nRules:\n\n1. Normal sudoku rules apply: Each row, column and 3x3 box contains each digit from 1 to 9 exactly once.\n\n2. Lines: Every line is either an Entropic Line or a Modular Line, but never both. Along an entropic line every set of three sequential digits contains one digit from each of the sets: {1,2,3}, {4,5,6}, and {7,8,9}. Along a Modular Line every set of three sequential digits contains one digit from each of the sets: {1,4,7}, {2,5,8}, and {3,6,9}.\n\n3. Cages: Digits in a cage sum to the cage total, to be discovered by the solver. The total of a cage must be divisible by the total of the cage contained within it. Digits may repeat in a cage if allowed by other rules.\n\n4. Kropki Dots: Digits joined by a white dot must be consecutive. Digits joined by a black dot must be in a 1:2 ratio (i.e. one is double the other). Not all possible dots are necessarily given.\n\n5. XV: Digits joined by an X must sum to 10. Digits joined by an V must sum to 5. Not all possible Xs and Vs are necessarily given\n\n6. Anti-King: Diagonally-adjacent cells do not contain the same digit.\n\nSolve on SudokuPad\n\nHave fun solving!\n\nHere you can find the other puzzles in the series:\n\nNATMOS 1: I'll Keep Holding On\nNATMOS 2: Just Out of Reach\nNATMOS 3: A brief moment in its right place\nNATMOS 4: Further Entanglements\nNATMOS 5: Greatest Cypress in Ion\nNATMOS 6: The rest is silence\n\nOriginal EATEOT series: [1] [2] [3] [4] [5] [6]\nEITBON series: [1] [2] [3] [4] [5] [6]\n[7]","solutionCode":"Row 1 (left to right, 9 digits)","tags":["Sudoku","XV (Variante)","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Entropie (Thema)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/98m36c2yb5","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/98m36c2yb5","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-01T06:18:27+00:00"}